---
/**
 * The answer to a how-to page in one line, at the top: where to go and what to press, with the
 * shortcut. The steps below it say the same thing slowly. In the plain-text copies it reads as
 * "In short: …".
 *
 *   <InShort>Right-click the move and select <Ui k="timeline.clipMenu.split" /> (<Kbd action="timelineSplitAtPlayhead" />).</InShort>
 */
---

<p class="docs-in-short">
    <span class="docs-in-short-label">In short:</span>
    <slot />
</p>

<style>
    .docs-in-short {
        padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
        border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
        border-radius: 0 0.375rem 0.375rem 0;
        background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    }
    .docs-in-short-label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    }
</style>
